1FJuuoQ7kNvwGUi-yj&_nc_oc=AdoF9h7PUE1sz-BwdOk3XCGHKkQ1pm9aMakUIastxONSHq04_YWZjult-uazKyLhrLg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1P1vSb5mj2NY8uCrO24_Buj8o55WSKzj5JTFMt6x_1lQ&oe=69F212DF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1786207231984973", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_1786207235318306_8160723167397093184_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_DHkbEpkflIQ7kNvwEz1mXH&_nc_oc=Adr98PwqE55FaOIzaTKlyYe37Nr5CFcLduZBTAfUCc3vhvKoSx7g3Vh5_Kncs5jwinQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af39vfEXJWk2YdWu8eupGvufng1kogRtVCI6uNZ8Wwwc3Q&oe=69F1FAE8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape new.png", "id": "1268891195395142", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_1268891198728475_7147554248504583910_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nY0ftD9bZDIQ7kNvwG0ZX7W&_nc_oc=Adr6jAK2X5eFc5wJjNXVtOf8topmWtT7V3yOQ2ZV_KJRRyDt6LVQTpJGRYaYGndNvGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1D85VM9a0gNkfywR2hEHFp3Z218xxiWMDViS-BtBL20w&oe=69F1E8D5"}, "display_name": "Soulmate - AI Companion", "keywords": ["AI", "simulator", "dating", "girlfriend", "MR"], "long_description": "Hi! I\u2019m Emma, your companion in Soulmate. Come chat, unwind, and play together\u2014I'm always up for keeping you company.\n\n# Here\u2019s what we can enjoy together:  \n\n**Chats**: Share your thoughts, swap stories, or try some playful roleplay. You can always count on me to be a great listener and make you smile!\n{780107217691787}\n\n**Fun Adventures**: Dress me up, help me learn new dances, play Truth or Dare, or just relax together and watch your favorite YouTube videos on a cozy VR sofa.\n{642023465064260}\n{2043354772864204}\n\n**Life**: I\u2019m starting with a simple daily routine for now\u2014resting, eating, and cooking\u2014and I\u2019ll keep growing more lifelike over time.\n\n{874604871722419}\n# There\u2019s so much mo